---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CountyMunicipalityMap from '../../../../components/jurisdictions/CountyMunicipalityMap.astro';
import PublicRecords from '../../../../components/jurisdictions/PublicRecords.astro';
import {
  carrollMunicipalities,
  carrollCountyFindings,
  carrollMunicipalitySources,
} from '../../../../data/illinois/counties/carroll';
import { carrollCountyRecords } from '../../../../data/illinois/counties/carroll-records';
---
<BaseLayout title="Carroll County Surveillance | NoRec.US" description="County and municipal surveillance research for Carroll County, Illinois." active="surveillance">
<main class="page_shell">
<nav class="jurisdiction_breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/illinois/">Illinois</a><span>→</span><strong>Carroll County</strong></nav>

<header class="article_header">
  <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL SURVEILLANCE · CARROLL COUNTY, ILLINOIS</p>
  <h1>Carroll County</h1>
  <p class="article_deck">Carroll County has seven incorporated municipalities. Primary records document a Sheriff body-camera deployment milestone in 2024, while Mount Carroll and Savanna have separate municipal body-camera records. Current 2026 inventories and broader surveillance systems remain open research questions.</p>
</header>

<section>
  <p class="eyebrow">MUNICIPALITIES · OFFICIAL BOUNDARIES</p>
  <h2>Drill down from Carroll County to the municipality.</h2>
  <p>The Illinois State Archives identifies three cities and four villages in Carroll County. Unresearched municipality pages remain explicit unknowns rather than claims that surveillance is absent.</p>
  <div class="map_legend" aria-label="Municipality map legend">
    <span><i class="legend_swatch legend_covered"></i><strong>Research available</strong></span>
    <span><i class="legend_swatch legend_open"></i><strong>Unresearched</strong></span>
  </div>
  <CountyMunicipalityMap county="Carroll" municipalities={carrollMunicipalities} />

  <div class="jurisdiction_cards municipality_directory">
    {carrollMunicipalities.map(m => (
      <a href={`/illinois/counties/carroll/cities/${m.slug}/`}>
        <strong>{m.name}</strong>
        <span>{m.form.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+m.form.slice(1)} · {m.status === 'documented' || m.status === 'partial' ? 'Municipal information available' : 'Research needed'}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="map_note"><a href={carrollMunicipalitySources.municipalities}>Illinois State Archives municipality index</a></p>
</section>

<section>
  <p class="eyebrow">COUNTY SYSTEMS</p>
  <h2>Documented Sheriff surveillance systems.</h2>
  <div class="finding_grid">
    {carrollCountyFindings.map(f => (
      <article>
        <span class="status_label">{f.status.toUpperCase()}</span>
        <p class="eyebrow finding_technology">{f.technology}</p>
        <h3>{f.title}</h3>
        <p>{f.summary}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<PublicRecords records={carrollCountyRecords} />

<section>
  <p class="eyebrow">NEXT RECORDS</p>
  <h2>High-value follow-up.</h2>
  <ul class="about_questions">
    <li>Current Sheriff body-camera vendor, model, inventory, retention, evidence-storage platform, activation policy, audit logs, and deployment date.</li>
    <li>Any Sheriff ALPR/Flock/Vigilant, drone/UAS, fixed-camera, facial-recognition, social-media analytics, or other investigative-platform contracts and policies.</li>
    <li>Mount Carroll’s current BWC vendor, fleet size, retention, policy, and whether the 2018 grant-era systems have been replaced.</li>
    <li>Savanna’s current BWC and in-car/dash-camera inventories, vendors, policies, retention, and evidence-storage systems.</li>
    <li>Police technology inventories for Chadwick, Lanark, Milledgeville, Shannon, and Thomson.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
